{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは生駒です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/01/17/6373377/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"口。ティラノサウルス。\nティラノサウルスもお洋服もmonomaniaです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう店員さんヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近テレビのロケや雑誌の企画で生駒得な企画が多くてにやにやがとまらない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にやにやしすぎて顔が痛いのよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く言いたいな。\nちと待っててね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ幸せ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にやにやにやにや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふふふふふふふふふ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/01/17/6373377/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/01/17/6373377/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらっ！\nテンション上がってこんな顔してしまたよ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/01/17/6373377/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あはは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ。\n皆さんひとりフードコート大丈夫って慰めてくれてありがとう(；ω；)\nなんかひとりフードコートまたしてもきっとさみしくないっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうっ(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！☆"}],"source":"archive"}